msgid "Moons"
msgstr "Moon"

msgid "Orbiting a moon adds its roots to this node's root set. ZeroTier keeps using the planetary roots as fallback. Note that upstream ZeroTier no longer recommends private moons and does not support them under its SLA."
msgstr "加入 moon 会把它的根节点加入本节点的根集合，ZeroTier 仍会回落到 planet 根节点。注意：上游 ZeroTier 已不再推荐私有 moon，且不在其 SLA 支持范围内。"

msgid "Add Moon"
msgstr "加入 Moon"

msgid "Moon ID"
msgstr "Moon ID"

msgid "Moon Seed"
msgstr "Moon 种子节点"

msgid "The 10-digit address of one of the moon's roots. ZeroTier fetches the moon definition from it."
msgstr "moon 某个根节点的 10 位地址，ZeroTier 将从它获取 moon 定义文件。"

msgid "Moon ID must be 10 hexadecimal digits (e.g. 123456abcd)"
msgstr "Moon ID 必须是 10 位十六进制字符（例如 123456abcd）"

msgid "Moon Seed must be the 10-digit address of one of the moon's roots"
msgstr "Moon 种子必须是该 moon 某个根节点的 10 位地址"

